CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 2 --por --allow-pointer-unsoundness --no-assertions --datarace
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
Racy control for `array_element_pointer_load`: the thread updates a[i]
holding a[0]'s mutex, so with both threads at i == 1 they race on
a[1].datum. Must stay FAILED before and after.
